  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1280766/description_c88bf0e9-0fd2-470d-a8ff-2d1770adb1cb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"149\"></h1>\n<p>-добывайте новые ресурсы</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172357/description_12e0f320-782f-4534-9161-1b97492ec533.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"325\" height=\"258\"></p>\n<p>-создавайте новые предметы</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172357/description_5fbadbb7-ca0a-4512-aaba-53ad5c5f6b02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"328\" height=\"151\"></p>\n<p>-улучшайте вашу экипировку</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172357/description_90caf68f-c827-434a-a99c-f636bec81dba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"330\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p>-торгуйте с новым жителем</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172357/description_c2b223d2-55f0-48e8-b08f-4e002bbc39f0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"191\" height=\"220\"></p>\n<p>-и многое другое</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172357/description_041001a9-8840-4647-9976-37a7be257236.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"328\" height=\"207\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">рекомендуется использовать вместе с JEI</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/29/69/64/64/635838945588716414.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"104\" height=\"104\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&lt;- скачать JEI</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">создано 123Fier6</span></p>",
